# Absolute path to the folder that directly contains the "MSF" folder (which
# in turn contains Gen 8/, Gen 9/, Gen 10/, Gen 11/). The NPI Library indexer
# (BackEnd/scripts/build-npi-index.js) writes MSF/NpiLibrary/index.json under
# this same tree; the BackEnd (NPI Library page) only ever reads that index.
NPI_DATA_DIR=
